#: scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67a02094d1fa8420924223f8c325566956248f1f6035dffdfd6efb201c9771ea
