msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is my mansion. ⟪k:1⟫My domain.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She was ⟪k:4⟫supposed⟪k:5⟫ to be locked up,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ここは私の館……、⟪k:1⟫私の世界。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女の魂は檻へと閉じ込めておいたはずなのに――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B1306B5_E4DA_499A_A661_6936ECC0D8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74132d9c8f9ba8e399246a5b491330ca983cea2eeb97aad05f9c49a0fcc6ab5f
