msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_850595D6_C0F9_4F1D_8BCA_0C908B221FF2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever nonsense that woman filled your head with,⟪k:1⟫it certainly seems to have put some "
"fight into those eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫何を吹き込まれたか知りませんけど……ずいぶんと、⟪k:1⟫顔つきが変わったじゃありませんか。⟪k:2⟫女"
"ひとりに慰められて、⟪k:3⟫結構なことですね。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5E250B83_3019_4707_A6F5_7B56EC625D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d32bc5b9449925f86defe7e246af9e6eed98e4a25c72558378460dca66cead8
