#: scenario7:scenario7_29672F16_4DBB_4F6D_B257_2FF5F887FC83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54ca6c0540cdb19446b2d844e6ada8f6c9d4837741d31df1ee9c5bf40a937529
