msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_29672F16_4DBB_4F6D_B257_2FF5F887FC83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was my despair that brought you back to life,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so that makes it my "
"responsibility to end this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……私の絶望が、⟪k:3⟫お前を蘇らせたのなら……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫すべてを終わらせる責任が――私には"
"ある。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb305f5f88ced915a7b3d90697db8efcadf57ddb6cffc45ca4ab9f2c6d4b1583
#. default-sha256: b46b36d9e4fe7a48f6eaf95b37ae31378b9d869ebe6da8ccf62a3dbc64c4e147
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My own wish has given me all the redemption I need, my dear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫私は私自身の願いにより、⟪k:2⟫とうに救われているのですよ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫それとも、⟪k:5⟫またあ"
"れですか？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cacb3bf6d75e7f82583390f1f784b6213256b0ec4771fbd8f367c52c6ac2e5c
#. default-sha256: 135cf3aee56e417e7518f4798e40fe5a935aa46548955ded70aa573dff9a801c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Or should I be expecting another self-righteous lecture about how “hatred does you no "
"good”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫憎しみは自分のためにならない……、⟪k:2⟫そのご高説を？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4b66ded5d3d922c987ef7565ed474027f7ef00aee0ab9174e1563e35199fe2b
#. default-sha256: c0eae8f82c193d37a554fc33d74740b49794ce1d724c2aaa2d5a7579902a9205
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Brilliant, Michel. Brilliant.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you have any idea how absurdly presumptuous "
"you’re being?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Trying to force your idea of redemption onto someone who has no interest "
"in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫傑作ね、⟪k:2⟫ミシェル……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫望まれていない救いほど、⟪k:5⟫押しつけがましく――滑稽な"
"ものはないわ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa5822fd37dce4f6cbf8cfae2ea0a2285299ce5c3c6f103afdd74b8937167c52
#. default-sha256: 3cc8e43804a2f7d9bf21c51d20c7e59edac7be1385bc95f76daf59e1f2583902
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If the tale you showed me was the whole truth..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫もしもすべての真実が、⟪k:3⟫お前が見せてくれた過去の通りなら……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫彼らの非情さ"
"を嘆き、⟪k:6⟫憎み――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27815d9844019111450f1691f52537de07918d3a6838a7f040e3906fcae62a6f
#. default-sha256: 2e3beec646b48131877ee4387bd17b5259964717527e6b702ce625ec7ad6aa8b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then I would have said you could revile those heartless men as much as you pleased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫好きに呪えと言ったかもしれない。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c7012598fd8e6aec6f4ccceea17a45d76a3c5f855d31c7fd796079ce8dfcf54
#. default-sha256: ebf8259420f926db074bd849bcd2ee687856a4d3bf2a9be51ec9d85500728669
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I refuse to believe that’s the whole story.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The men I saw beyond the first "
"three doors had genuine concerns and worries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし私には、⟪k:1⟫あれですべてが終わりだとは思えない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私が見てきた扉の奥で……、"
"⟪k:4⟫彼らは人として悩み――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d62be4949fa6c025ea3c65ae1a01b4341fc7da6e62f74b953aa7bd0b27593b12
#. default-sha256: 190a72b4f72168237410aec574bcced5d5f28d591646a488f7b1ab4549455064
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They felt things—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫real, human emotions—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫even if those things ultimately "
"led them down a path of destruction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫最後には破滅を迎えたとしても、⟪k:1⟫その過程には様々な感情があった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫誰かに優しくした"
"かったという想いや――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5495594435746e17e714f6c4223abe1488d61d172569baf98001fc6ab0f9f01
#. default-sha256: 5b5e449287b00184c47efbc8869b1b40a239c4addfa6c61dba71df25bcb20cb1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wanting to do something nice for the one you care about,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫being disgusted at things "
"you’ve done,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫hiding your urges from those around you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自分自身に対する反発……、⟪k:1⟫そして隠されていた情。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4c05c279b66e938b82ef3bcd460a5518cdc0b0117d295c0dc825b220c3a0060
#. default-sha256: 416a84dcdf0d3bab54ad77d9f0b3ec36b4244dd146c65733c9db8cb793c5a161
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You certainly couldn’t call them ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ men,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but they were real people with "
"real conflicts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫決して、⟪k:1⟫善人とは括れないかもしれないが……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それでも彼らは、⟪k:4⟫とても人間的な葛"
"藤を抱えていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_820226CB_A379_4EDB_AC2C_5046718D471D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efa3471f3f9df4a4aa17c13b190cdef72a3bbba6fe97af4f569cc1451c7f1ca
#. default-sha256: 0d4386650e4967de511df1aae0632ef571e9fe4cccc07b061b1f8fca5a44224c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_820226CB_A379_4EDB_AC2C_5046718D471D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...So you’re saying I’m lying?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……つまり、⟪k:2⟫私が、⟪k:3⟫嘘をついているとでも？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E88E04_7456_4076_8BFF_6E0903327CD8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 964da2014ea067935903da8c1454ffe8d4abe23dd9bc736ae4424cf0b97c361f
