#: scenario7:scenario7_1CC25982_A7E2_4DBD_8E96_356416572920
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c5215642dd1afcf070e55fb17b0df8240652533160c1993b904906f2ffea8b0
#. default-sha256: 2d6c9991cbc885237a0ebde032c4fed701b0c68fcc560b22a34dcce5329de6ac
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1CC25982_A7E2_4DBD_8E96_356416572920"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I’ve learned something in my years...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫“reality” exists from more than "
"one perspective."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫けれど、⟪k:3⟫私は……自らの人生で理解したんだ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫真実は、⟪k:6⟫決して一方から"
"見るものではないと……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E9A67E66_6358_49E9_99D4_D41170DB11DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81081661af11da64132e2d4d2e000f538b1f02826c5d9fdea1ad3825a1920ff0
#. default-sha256: d44ef9c50ba1eece142bc69460e97b53d464877d2ab08c3467240ac34d65f5d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E9A67E66_6358_49E9_99D4_D41170DB11DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That doesn’t change what happened. ⟪k:2⟫That two-faced young man deceived me, the beast "
"severed my arm,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫――起きたことは、⟪k:2⟫何も変わりはしないわ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫偽善的な青年が私を騙したこと、⟪k:5⟫"
"獣が私の腕を斬り落としたこと、"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6B0522_07E8_4613_8A05_B60AA2C61F44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff7364309bc5a60799447c0e31f3c901a43e057c51160ee19a738be6a628095d
#. default-sha256: 7955066cf3d2a2e29048e9138c2831e3b4a8808527eb53af8751e87ce8f5d63c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6B0522_07E8_4613_8A05_B60AA2C61F44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the greedy, power-hungry lord used me for his own personal gain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして――あの男が私を金と権力の踏み台にしたこと。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BC69931_8297_49C0_A574_2FF84970AB3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50060d70b0bdd7c766ed0dde6839fcd062e24dfa1566755e0e3cfd57dc7357e4
#. default-sha256: b39ef7f7a49d7cf3ed1b65dbdc40f17f715f03be1fd20a8ae97c9feef9190b20
