msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Events by themselves do not tell the whole story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……起きた事実だけを、⟪k:3⟫真相とは呼ばない……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6CF88E1B_9969_4BD2_ABFE_E1E6E52625D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea859549144c8cc88fdcefed5d100d671ca67437e35376f3f4edea10e21d2730
#. default-sha256: 3210437a3bd1a7dee010d63cd53d50cbaa41b6aef251fff20857ef30e1a15989
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6CF88E1B_9969_4BD2_ABFE_E1E6E52625D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Only when you take into account ⟪k:1⟫their⟪k:2⟫ circumstances,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫what they thought "
"and felt, ⟪k:5⟫their perspectives—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫only then can you say you’ve reached the truth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その裏にあった彼らの想いや、⟪k:1⟫すべての事情を含むことで――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それは真相と呼べるものに"
"なるんだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01DCE80E_DA26_4BDB_AA36_30F2E78F77E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94d00fd8f64b64a2c29ed2d810ab54a6f2fdab0f6b7a8137f0273352f67bbf65
