msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Your point being?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………だから？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_65F55687_47CA_44BB_9241_F618C7BEA063
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eeb9cf0523befa42125f279c04dfb807126b178550973e01ea6e885b6bd6b9e
#. default-sha256: 254dddbb1e3298cddaabac7f291bbb62d0779a5b21febb7831d734fd96ee97fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_65F55687_47CA_44BB_9241_F618C7BEA063"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you going to march down to where their souls are and ⟪k:2⟫ask⟪k:3⟫ them for their "
"perspective? ⟪k:4⟫Don’t waste your breath. They’ll only tell you what benefits themselves the "
"most."
